{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — T01 Ingredient Education
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-editorial-section" id="ingredients">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 52px;">
      <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">WHAT WE PUT IN (AND LEAVE OUT)</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2">Pure Botanical Integrity</h2>
      <p>Formulated with high-potency, cold-pressed plant lipids and clean bioactive nutrients. Zero cheap fillers, silicones, or sulfates.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 28px;">
      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card">
        <div style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">🌿</div>
        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">Raw Honduran Batana Oil</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;">Elaeis Oleifera</div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">Rich in oleic and linoleic essential fatty acids (Omega-6 and 9) that penetrate deeply into hair follicles to restore moisture balance and reinforce cuticle tensile strength.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card">
        <div style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">🧬</div>
        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">Hydrolyzed Keratin Protein</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;">Structural Amino Acids</div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">Micro-fine plant-derived keratin fibers carry a natural electrostatic charge, bonding instantly with fine human hair fibers to create seamless visual thickness and density.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="zvhc-editorial-card">
        <div style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">💧</div>
        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-bottom: 4px;">Cold-Pressed Castor &amp; Argan</div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;">Ricinoleic Acid &amp; Vitamin E</div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; margin: 0;">Castor oil provides intense moisture cushioning for delicate hairline edges, while Moroccan Argan adds reflective high-gloss shine without weighing curls down.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Clean Standards Strip -->
    <div style="margin-top: 40px; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: var(--zvhc-radius-card, 14px); padding: 22px 28px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-around; align-items: center; gap: 16px; text-align: center;">
      <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">🌿 100% CLEAN BOTANICAL</div>
      <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">🐰 CRUELTY-FREE</div>
      <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">🚫 NO PARABENS OR SULFATES</div>
      <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24);">🧪 DERMATOLOGICALLY TESTED</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC T01 Ingredients",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
